            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Leech Essence"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nWhen the lifeleecher damages a living or undead creature with their jaws Strike, they drain the target's life essence. The lifeleecher gains 5 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 minute, and the target must succeed at a 24 Fortitude save or become drained 1 if living, or stunned 1 if undead. If the target was already drained or stunned, the value of this condition instead increases by 1, to a maximum of 3."
            },
